      "id": "o_forward",
      "lane": "operator",
      "step": 1,
      "title": "融合前向",
      "subtitle": "Dispatch → 专家计算 → 回源",
      "symbol": "MegaMoeBF16Forward::Process",
      "description": [
        "专家卡拉取路由 token，计算 Gate/Up、SwiGLU 与 p 加权，再执行 GMM2。专家贡献回传到源 rank，按 token 的 TopK 槽位归并为 Y。具体依赖由 ready 和缓冲交接控制，不是每个阶段都做全局同步。"
      ],
      "reads": [
        "X、路由、W1、W2",
        "通信 context"
      ],
      "writes": [
        "Y [M,K]",
        "counts [E]",
        "前向持久状态"
      ],
      "waits": [
        "当前输入 ready",
        "UB 复用与通信读写边界"
      ],
      "formula": "Rbf16(x) 表示将 x 舍入到 BF16。GEMM 使用 FP32 累加。\nG = Rbf16(Xpacked · Wgᵀ)\nU = Rbf16(Xpacked · Wuᵀ)\nH = SiLU_FP32(G) × FP32(U)\nHp = Rbf16(H × FP32(p))\nOroute = Rbf16(Hp · W2ᵀ)\nY = Rbf16(Σ_FP32 Oroute)  # 按 TopK 槽求和后写回 BF16",
      "sources": [
        {
